rationale	Measured on the identical fixture above each island's own threshold. one-dof: {"f0_hz": 162.16216216216216, "jitter": 0.0006704796675208842, "onset_pa_class": 5800.0, "open_quotient": 0.8441666666666666, "spectral_slope_db_oct": -6.647044886776893}. two-mass: {"f0_hz": 186.04651162790697, "jitter": 0.0018958898937950302, "onset_pa_class": 500.0, "open_quotient": 0.8086805555555555, "spectral_slope_db_oct": -11.536887546653732}. The onset classes differ 10x (5.8 vs 0.5 kPa under the corrected volume-normalized load) — the budget/realism split D21 keeps both for.
